      "item_body": "<p>For each function f(x), determine i. the critical numbers ii. the intervals of increase and decrease iii. the local maximum and minimum values (classify each critical number) iv. a sketch of the graph</p>\n<p>a. f(x) = x^2 - 7x - 18; i. critical number: x = <span id=\"blank_058a0a26-954a-4d66-9477-94794b1930db\"></span>; ii. increasing: <span id=\"blank_6c2c7da2-711b-417e-adc1-8568057ed381\"></span>; decreasing: <span id=\"blank_db7d6515-5cba-460f-8fac-53983a878252\"></span>; iii. local <span id=\"blank_dc41602e-8a59-45bc-9bf8-752cd35237ff\"></span> at x = 7/2</p>\n<p>b. f(x) = -2x^3 + 9x^2 + 3; i. critical numbers: x = <span id=\"blank_0d34fc1e-3d6a-42b0-bc51-2236e1894494\"></span>, x = <span id=\"blank_89dcd4b3-6280-4ede-b00a-3f02a92427c8\"></span>; ii. increasing: <span id=\"blank_7a092b74-32b7-43c0-aba4-17032b9418d5\"></span>; decreasing: <span id=\"blank_d26d5892-d322-43a9-9695-5fec24ee0e89\"></span>; iii. local <span id=\"blank_929b1b91-b18e-4ce3-afd0-be210f379095\"></span> at x = 0, local <span id=\"blank_30b2f512-f0ee-469a-ae49-7eff5beea744\"></span> at x = 3</p>\n<p>c. f(x) = 2x^4 - 4x^2 + 2; i. critical numbers: x = <span id=\"blank_bb0b212b-545b-44f0-9880-a5233f4871c6\"></span>, x = <span id=\"blank_72c4de02-e00c-49cf-b766-d1e4c4f6d99e\"></span>, x = <span id=\"blank_a87b1731-7d0a-441d-b1ce-6adb511bc4e2\"></span>; ii. increasing: <span id=\"blank_d5f24375-3e15-467a-94f4-7ded0481d133\"></span>; decreasing: <span id=\"blank_2c911384-00a6-4fd8-8f90-419d1020d8d3\"></span>; iii. local <span id=\"blank_34cdc6a4-6477-4000-af2d-b5d329e1cdca\"></span> at x = 0, local <span id=\"blank_401be82f-e063-4a5b-b286-bd4357fb0495\"></span> at x = 1, local <span id=\"blank_1f69e6e5-82b2-48b2-aa48-6049b4244440\"></span> at x = -1</p>\n<p>d. f(x) = x^5 - 5x; i. critical numbers: x = <span id=\"blank_b82e7c3c-ae6d-4199-bd96-d3c12101e84d\"></span>, x = <span id=\"blank_e24295f4-7796-4b94-9d0b-c90e79b26100\"></span>; ii. increasing: <span id=\"blank_aacfc58